# Optional local overrides. Never commit real credentials.
#
# The relay endpoint the room service mints credentials against. Leave this
# unset until a draft-20 endpoint is available and has passed Gate 1. Do not
# point it at an earlier draft as a live-audio fallback.
# MOQ_RELAY_URL=https://draft-20.example.invalid
#
# Signs the short-lived, room-scoped relay credential (§8). Set it in production
# with `wrangler secret put MOQ_RELAY_SECRET`. Without it the credential is
# still scoped and still expires, but it is marked unsigned rather than
# presented as something a relay could trust.
# MOQ_RELAY_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string
